sequenceDiagram
    participant K as Kafka
    participant R as KafkaReader
    participant W as orders_worker
    participant D as DW (PostgreSQL)
    participant C as Redis Cache

    K->>R: consume event batch
    activate R
    R->>R: normalize JSON
    R->>W: handle_orders_batch()
    activate W
    W->>D: upsert dim_customers/dim_products
    W->>D: insert fact_sales
    W->>R: ack(last_offset)
    R->>K: commit offset
    W->>C: invalidate sales:*
    deactivate W
    deactivate R

    note over R,W: Kafka metrics:<br/>- partitions<br/>- commits<br/>- poll size<br/>- lag
